### Cleaner App - API Admin Tests (CORRIGÉ - Routes existantes uniquement)
### Fichier basé UNIQUEMENT sur les contrôleurs, DTOs et schéma Prisma réels
### Routes vérifiées dans les contrôleurs existants

@baseUrl = https://backend-cleaner-nestjs.onrender.com/api/v1
@contentType = application/json
@adminEmail = admin@cleaner.com
@adminPassword = admin123

### ==================== AUTHENTIFICATION ====================

### 1. Inscription Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "firstName": "Admin",
  "lastName": "Super",
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "phone": "+237699999999",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}",
  "confirmPassword": "{{adminPassword}}",
  "role": "ADMIN",
  "neighborhood": "Akwa"
}

### 2. Connexion Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### 3. Obtenir le profil Admin connecté
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer VOTRE_TOKEN_ADMIN_ICI

### 4. Demande de réinitialisation mot de passe
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/request-password-reset
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "emailOrPhone": "{{adminEmail}}"
}

### 5. Réinitialisation mot de passe
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "emailOrPhone": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "code": "123456",
  "newPassword": "newAdmin123",
  "confirmPassword": "newAdmin123"
}

